{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cOrganize and arrange the unique Tab\u00e9mons (*) at will and defend the hotpot from the onrushing enemies!\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0If the seal of the hotpot is broken, the world will be consumed by the spilled darkness and become a dark hotpot of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0This is a tower defense food battle to save the world by defending the dark hotpot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(*) Tab\u00e9mons are strange creatures that look like food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/\u934ben2.gif?t=1741532962\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Tab\u00e9mons guarding the hotpot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0The Tab\u00e9mons in the defense unit vary in personality and ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once deployed, they fight hard to protect the hotpot according to their own personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Form a formation that takes advantage of their individuality and use their unique skills to protect the hotpot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517370/extras/Tabemons3_en.png?t=1741532962\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The lands of hotpot defending, and enemy Tab\u00e9mons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0The enemies who attack in search of the darkness of the hotpot are also unique Tab\u00e9mons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0In this game, fierce battles between Tab\u00e9mons take place in various lands of hotpot defending (stages).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0And although they are formidable adversaries, they may join the ranks of hotpot defenders by fighting them off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0As the game progresses, the 